o stay disciplined as pressure grows over his leadership. Meanwhile, Germany's homeownership rate has fallen to its lowest level in 20 years. DW has the latest.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Ukraine: AfD questions German aid, Berlin remains committed</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e2f16c987cb000f4a68a9046a1caa4344a6d9ca7cb6005ae3491f9f012044962</id><updated>2026-09-14T15:06:43Z</updated><published>2026-09-14T12:46:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ukraine-afd-questions-german-aid-berlin-remains-committed/a-79257524--cdb3e9ec23f4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ukraine-afd-questions-german-aid-berlin-remains-committed/a-79257524?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Emboldened by its win in Saxony-Anhalt, the far-right Alternative for Germany wants the government to change its Ukraine and Russia policies. Berlin is staying the course, but support is fading — especially in the east.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>The Crusades: How a medieval Holy War still shapes politics</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e636b5c93be0cdc0fe4ab822112edeea1fec8a653adf8bd6dc3d124c44f14b2e</id><updated>2026-09-14T15:06:46Z</updated><published>2026-09-14T12:43:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/the-crusades-how-a-medieval-holy-war-still-shapes-politics/a-79203784--8fa07b173177.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/the-crusades-how-a-medieval-holy-war-still-shapes-politics/a-79203784?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">In 1095, the Catholic Church launched the Crusades: wars that left millions dead and whose legacy still shapes political and ideological conflicts.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Nepal: thousands still missing as flood recovery begins</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:57af571cb87a4542ee525a5819abe97a50f49ec389d31732746c97e91cc5faf7</